**Read:** [A sustained book and graduate-course programme](../study/A-sustained-book-and-graduate-course-programme.lingua#r_4P4AF2QKRVED55XXYWDRFD47B3), the complete sustained programme; [A sustained fluid experimental programme](../practice/A-sustained-fluid-experimental-programme.lingua#r_44MEVXT1S9AQTHW3NM4R6WET66), performed work with traceable evidence; [A complete fluid-service investigation](A-complete-fluid-service-investigation.lingua#r_688VD7S50KPEC6CY2Y8KY3K0F5), the complete defended service investigation; [An independent fluid-dynamics research question](An-independent-fluid-dynamics-research-question.lingua#r_3E8DPHG6DWB1FPCNXXM1NC6HJD), a substantial independently examined contribution.

Demonstrate the foundations without relying on a familiar problem template: define quantities and frames, derive the relevant integral/local balances, choose justified constitutive and boundary conditions, estimate scales, recover limiting cases and explain a contradictory observation. Complete the sustained introductory and advanced readings with independent problems, retaining the mathematical preparation where it is needed.

Show substantial work across exact viscous and potential limits, boundary layers/instability/turbulence, compressible and free-surface waves, interfaces/multiple phases/complex fluids, transport, and numerical/measurement evidence. The advanced studies specify concrete investigations for these areas. Develop complete investigations in each major family and deepen a chosen direction through the full specialist books, primary literature and an independently defended research result. Reusing a model requires understanding the assumptions relevant to the new question.

Complete the performed experimental programme and the integrated fluid-service investigation, then revise a substantial independent study after criticism and reproduction. Keep simulated, documentary and physically performed evidence distinct. Explain what another person can reproduce, which conclusions the evidence supports and which specialist questions remain open. No finite reading list exhausts fluid science; finishing this route means demonstrating this demanding range of understanding and work, with a clear direction for further inquiry.

**Return:** [Fluid dynamics — motion, forces, transport and evidence](../Fluid-dynamics.lingua#r_7PQW1WDHK708BFV23MD8ET61VZ).
